WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:12.239
Connect Facebook and Instagram, and your approved posts go out to your Pages and Instagram accounts at the time you choose. Then you see how each one did, and answer comments, all from Worklynq.

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:23.659
In the Admin console, open Apps, and choose Facebook and Instagram, under Marketing and website. Sign in with Facebook, and approve the Pages Worklynq may post to.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:30.948
Each Page is listed with the Instagram account linked to it. Tick the ones to post to, and leave out any you don’t use.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:41.064
Then say which location each Page belongs to. A post for Riverside goes to Riverside’s Page, and a whole-company post goes to every Page that’s on.

00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:51.377
Now, in Social, click New post, and pick Facebook and Instagram. Say what it’s about, and Write with AI drafts a version for each, in your brand voice.

00:00:51.833 --> 00:01:00.409
Instagram posts need a photo, so add one too. Each version keeps to that platform’s limits, and the preview shows which Pages it will go to.

00:01:00.867 --> 00:01:08.568
Pick when it should go out, and send it for approval. Nothing is posted until it’s approved, and then it goes out on its own, at that time.

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:17.567
Results shows how each post did on each channel: views, reactions, comments and shares, from Facebook and Instagram themselves.

00:01:18.633 --> 00:01:24.735
Comments on your posts come into the Inbox. Ana asked on Facebook whether the cardamom buns are vegan.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:32.581
Write with AI suggests replies in your brand voice. Pick one, check it, and send it. It’s posted under your Page’s name.

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:37.705
Worklynq never posts without your say, and you can disconnect at any time from Apps.

